    "source_observations": [
      "Combined Query deduplicates CacheKey objects by ID. Non-main duplicate selection depends on concurrent query completion, not cache-from argument order.",
      "A new imported CacheKey initially records only its source manager; Combined Records iterates managers in the selected key.ids map.",
      "A partial result-less record could therefore shadow a full result if identical key IDs collide. A controlled exact-only versus exact-plus-partial import witness is required."
